{"overview":"پس از پایان مراسم افتتاح فدراسیون پادشاهی شیاطین «طوفان»، ریمورو و همراهانش توسط امپراتور آسمانی هرمسیه از امپراتوری بزرگ الف‌ها – سلسله جادویی سالیون – به بازدید از جزیره خصوصی تفریحی او دعوت می‌شوند. در حالی که گروه از تعطیلات کوتاه خود لذت می‌برند، زنی مرموز به نام یورا ظاهر می‌شود. حادثه‌ای جدید در پس‌زمینه‌ی دریای آبی بی‌کران رخ می‌دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After concluding the opening ceremony of the Demon Kingdom Federation Tempest, Rimuru and his companions are invited by the Celestial Emperor Hermesia of the great elven nation – the Magi Dynasty Salion – to visit her private resort island. As the group enjoys their brief vacation, a mysterious woman named Yura appears. A new incident unfolds against the backdrop of the boundless azure sea.","tagline_en":"","runtime":105,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["菊地康仁"],"crew_en":["Yasuhito Kikuchi"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"岡咲美保","role":"Rimuru (voice)","photo":"/cTkMJzOdsXL8o5q5AhP9eT0sXDK.jpg","en":"Miho Okasaki"},{"name":"مائو ایچیمیچی","role":"Shion (voice)","photo":"/a3cflYtrlFK0LXfWODgLDO7E7CP.jpg","en":"Mao Ichimichi"},{"name":"前野智昭","role":"Veldora (voice)","photo":"/w3lEuXSbEyzzNyO3YnxsF6wm2N5.jpg","en":"Tomoaki Maeno"},{"name":"古川慎","role":"Benimaru (voice)","photo":"/inLmBZhrqXeE9wlViyK28ocKJSw.jpg","en":"Makoto Furukawa"},{"name":"千本木彩花","role":"Shuna (voice)","photo":"/yLRKX9DPDGgTRKBQRFTUh3pvbU0.jpg","en":"Sayaka Senbongi"},{"name":"金元寿子","role":"Elmesia (voice)","photo":"/qyJPQaehMc4Sy5jaTfIJLdrll2v.jpg","en":"Hisako Kanemoto"},{"name":"堂本光一","role":"Zodon (voice)","photo":"/h9cWAz0ZMdiJvZFcXdd0GQJHQO6.jpg","en":"Koichi Domoto"},{"name":"大西沙織","role":"Yura (voice)","photo":"/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg","en":"Saori Onishi"},{"name":"遊佐浩二","role":"Djeese (voice)","photo":"/vBo8dHvZvbG4kax0LcaWvrXUZuX.jpg","en":"Koji Yusa"},{"name":"江口拓也","role":"Soei (voice)","photo":"/hPPhUp0mM65Lc87Q8WXUEmGQAXx.jpg","en":"Takuya Eguchi"},{"name":"春野杏","role"